      "english": "Peddler: You cannot eat a baked sweet potato immediately after you buy it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wait a while, it will cool down, won’t it?"
    }
